From 468cd3bd3cbecb3006d62a78b8a61554a9d549b7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Niccol=C3=B2=20Venerandi?= <niccolo@venerandi.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 03:39:21 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] libtaskmanager: use the desktop file a window was launched
 from

When two desktop files start the same program, its windows share an app
id, so they always got the program's own desktop file and icon. Now the
launch app id sent by KWin wins when it runs the same executable.

BUG: 475736
---
 .../data/applications/dolphin-handler.desktop |  9 +++++
 .../data/applications/dolphin-home.desktop    |  7 ++++
 .../data/applications/dolphin-webapp.desktop  |  8 +++++
 libtaskmanager/autotests/tasktoolstest.cpp    | 30 +++++++++++++++++
 libtaskmanager/tasktools.cpp                  | 33 ++++++++++++++++---
 libtaskmanager/tasktools.h                    |  9 +++--
 libtaskmanager/waylandtasksmodel.cpp          | 10 ++++--
 7 files changed, 98 insertions(+), 8 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 libtaskmanager/autotests/data/applications/dolphin-handler.desktop
 create mode 100644 libtaskmanager/autotests/data/applications/dolphin-home.desktop
 create mode 100644 libtaskmanager/autotests/data/applications/dolphin-webapp.desktop

diff --git a/libtaskmanager/autotests/data/applications/dolphin-handler.desktop b/libtaskmanager/autotests/data/applications/dolphin-handler.desktop
new file mode 100644
index 0000000000..b904ac827b
--- /dev/null
+++ b/libtaskmanager/autotests/data/applications/dolphin-handler.desktop
@@ -0,0 +1,9 @@
+# SPDX-FileCopyrightText: none
+# SPDX-License-Identifier: CC0-1.0
